SUMMARY:2nd Annual Easter Egg Dump at FLIP
DESCRIPTION:Pour eggs on your head! Make paper bunnies and enjoy the Easter scavenger hunt too. We aren’t offering a traditional egg hunt\, but we promise this will be even more fun. We also have fun Passover crafts set up as well\, like our Matzo house and paper frogs with shooting tongues. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
