DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Passover at FLIP by making a Matzo House and Paper Frogs with Shooting Tongues. Also enjoy the Easter activities while you are here\, including the infamous Egg Dump. All our normal exhibits will be available as well\, like our Green Screen Stage and Cartoon-Making Room. \n$10/Person\, Under Age 2 is Free \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission. \n 
